# Cursor Rules for DDD Page Builder Project

## Language Settings
- Always respond in English
- Always write comments in English
- Use clear, concise language for all code explanations
- Generate code with English comments to explain functionality

## Code Style Guidelines
- Use TypeScript for type safety
- Follow React best practices
- Use TailwindCSS for styling
- Write descriptive variable and function names
- Include JSDoc comments for complex functions

## Comment Standards
- Write comments in English only
- Use clear and descriptive language
- Explain the "why" not just the "what"
- Keep comments up to date with code changes
- Use consistent comment formatting

## AI Assistant Behavior
- Always generate code with English comments
- Explain complex logic in English
- Provide English documentation
- Use English for all variable names and function names when possible
- Respond to questions in English

## Project Specific Rules
- This is a Next.js project with TypeScript
- Use GrapeJS for the page editor functionality
- Follow shadcn/ui component patterns
- Maintain consistent code formatting with Prettier 